Core Idea}\cell\pard\plain \s27\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081\ab \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\qc\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\noline\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\b\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch\intbl{\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\loch\fs22\b0\loch
Famous Supporters / Views}\cell\row\pard\trowd\trql\ltrrow\trpaddft3\trpaddt0\trpaddfl3\trpaddl0\trpaddfb3\trpaddb0\trpaddfr3\trpaddr0\clpadfl3\clpadl28\clpadft3\clpadt28\clpadfb3\clpadb28\clpadfr3\clpadr28\clvertalc\cellx2294\clpadfl3\clpadl28\clpadft3\clpadt28\clpadfb3\clpadb28\clpadfr3\clpadr28\clvertalc\cellx6606\clpadfl3\clpadl28\clpadft3\clpadt28\clpadfb3\clpadb28\clpadfr3\clpadr28\clvertalc\cellx9638\pard\plain \s26\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\noline\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch\intbl{\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\loch\cs16\rtlch\ab \ltrch\loch\b\fs22\b0\loch
Continuity theory}\cell\pard\plain \s26\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\noline\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch\intbl{\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\loch\fs22\b0\loch
