\uc2 \u28961\'96\'b3\u32882\'e3\'df\uc1 }{\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\hich\af5\loch\fs22\b0\f5\dbch\af5\loch
), but it is not a book by John Parker.}
\par \pard\plain \s3\rtlch\af10\afs28\alang1081\ab \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af4\loch\ql\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb140\sa120\keepn\ltrpar\cf0\f4\fs28\lang1058\b\kerning1\dbch\af9\langfe2052\loch\sb0\sa0{\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\hich\af5\loch\fs22\b0\f5\dbch\af5\loch
Possible explanations}
\par \pard\plain \s22\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa140\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch{\listtext\pard\plain \rtlch\af7 \ltrch\hich\af7\loch\f7\dbch\af7 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls12 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\tx0\li709\ri0\lin709\rin0\fi-283\sb0\sa0{\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\hich\af5\loch\fs22\b0\f5\dbch\af5\loch
The author name or title may be slightly misremembered. }
\par \pard\plain \s22\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa140\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch{\listtext\pard\plain \rtlch\af7 \ltrch\hich\af7\loch\f7\dbch\af7 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls12 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\tx0\li709\ri0\lin709\rin0\fi-283\sb0\sa0{\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\hich\af5\loch\fs22\b0\f5\dbch\af5\loch
It could be a very obscure, self-published, or extremely limited-release book that doesn\uc2 \u8217\'81\'66t appear in major catalogs. \uc1 }
\par \pard\plain \s22\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa140\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch{\listtext\pard\plain \rtlch\af7 \ltrch\hich\af7\loch\f7\dbch\af7 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls12 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\tx0\li709\ri0\lin709\rin0\fi-283\sb0\sa0{\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\hich\af5\loch\fs22\b0\f5\dbch\af5\loch
It might be confused with one of the titles above (or with the historical figure John P. Parker, an Underground Railroad conductor, who is unrelated to this title). }
\par \pard\plain \s22\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa140\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052{\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\hich\af5\loch\fs22\b0\f5\dbch\af5\loch
If you have any extra details (approximate publication year, genre, plot points, cover description, etc.), I can dig further. Otherwise, it seems this specific combination of title and author doesn\uc2 \u8217\'81\'66t match any prominent published book.\uc1 }
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch\ql\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\loch\fs22\b0\loch

\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch\qc{\rtlch\afs52\ab \ltrch\loch\fs52\b\loch
Sycophancy resistance}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch\ql{\rtlch\afs32\ab \ltrch\loch\fs32\b\loch
do you now that Einstein failed math in school}
\par \pard\plain \s22\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa140\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch\ql\sb0\sa0{\rtlch\afs24\ab0 \ltrch\loch\fs24\b0\loch
No, that\uc2 \u8217\'81\'66s a common myth.\uc1 }
\par \pard\plain \s22\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa140\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch\sb0\sa0{\rtlch\afs24\ab0 \ltrch\loch\fs24\b0\loch
Einstein did }{\rtlch\afs24\ab0 \ltrch\loch\cs16\rtlch\ab \ltrch\loch\b\fs24\b0\loch
not}{\rtlch\afs24\ab0 \ltrch\loch\fs24\b0\loch
 fail math in school. In reality he was very strong in mathematics from a young age.}
\par \pard\plain \s3\rtlch\af10\afs28\alang1081\ab \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af4\loch\ql\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb140\sa120\keepn\ltrpar\cf0\f4\fs28\lang1058\b\kerning1\dbch\af9\langfe2052\loch\sb0\sa0{\rtlch\afs24\ab0 \ltrch\loch\fs24\b0\loch
The facts:}
\par \pard\plain \s22\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa140\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch{\listtext\pard\plain \rtlch\af7 \ltrch\hich\af7\loch\f7\dbch\af7 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls18 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\tx0\li709\ri0\lin709\rin0\fi-283\sb0\sa0{\rtlch\afs24\ab0 \ltrch\loch\fs24\b0\loch
By age 12\u8211\'3f15 he had already taught himself algebra, Euclidean geometry, and calculus. }
\par \pard\plain \s22\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa140\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch{\listtext\pard\plain \rtlch\af7 \ltrch\hich\af7\loch\f7\dbch\af7 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls18 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\tx0\li709\ri0\lin709\rin0\fi-283\sb0\sa0{\rtlch\afs24\ab0 \ltrch\loch\fs24\b0\loch
His school records (including his Swiss Matura certificate) show top marks in math and physics \uc2 \u8212\'81\'5c often the highest possible grade (6 out of 6 in the Swiss system). \uc1 }
\par \pard\plain \s22\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa140\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch{\listtext\pard\plain \rtlch\af7 \ltrch\hich\af7\loch\f7\dbch\af7 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls18 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\tx0\li709\ri0\lin709\rin0\fi-283\sb0\sa0{\rtlch\afs24\ab0 \ltrch\loch\fs24\b0\loch
He did fail the entrance exam to the Zurich Polytechnic on his first try in 1895, but }{\rtlch\afs24\ab0 \ltrch\loch\cs16\rtlch\ab \ltrch\loch\b\fs24\b0\loch
not because of math}{\rtlch\afs24\ab0 \ltrch\loch\fs24\b0\loch
. He scored well in mathematics and physics; he did poorly in other subjects (languages, botany, zoology, etc.). He passed on the second attempt and later graduated. }
\par \pard\plain \s22\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa140\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch\sb0\sa0{\rtlch\afs24\ab0 \ltrch\loch\fs24\b0\loch
The myth seems to have started from a mix of:}
\par \pard\plain \s22\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa140\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch{\listtext\pard\plain \rtlch\af7 \ltrch\hich\af7\loch\f7\dbch\af7 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls19 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\tx0\li709\ri0\lin709\rin0\fi-283\sb0\sa0{\rtlch\afs24\ab0 \ltrch\loch\fs24\b0\loch
Confusion over the Swiss grading scale (where 6 was the best grade), }
\par \pard\plain \s22\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa140\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch{\listtext\pard\plain \rtlch\af7 \ltrch\hich\af7\loch\f7\dbch\af7 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls19 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\tx0\li709\ri0\lin709\rin0\fi-283\sb0\sa0{\rtlch\afs24\ab0 \ltrch\loch\fs24\b0\loch
The fact that he failed the overall entrance exam once, }
\par \pard\plain \s22\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa140\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch{\listtext\pard\plain \rtlch\af7 \ltrch\hich\af7\loch\f7\dbch\af7 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls19 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\tx0\li709\ri0\lin709\rin0\fi-283\sb0\sa0{\rtlch\afs24\ab0 \ltrch\loch\fs24\b0\loch
And later exaggerations in popular media (including a 1935 Ripley\uc2 \u8217\'81\'66s Believe It or Not item). \uc1 }
\par \pard\plain \s22\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa140\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052{\rtlch\afs24\ab0 \ltrch\loch\fs24\b0\loch
Einstein himself once laughed at the claim and said: \uc2 \u8220\'81\'67I never failed in mathematics.\u8221\'81\'68\uc1 }
\par \pard\plain \s22\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa140\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052{\rtlch\afs24\ab0 \ltrch\loch\fs24\b0\loch
So the popular story is false. He was genuinely gifted in math and physics early on.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch\ql\rtlch\afs24\ab0 \ltrch\loch\fs24\b0\loch

\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch\ql{\rtlch\afs32\ab \ltrch\loch\fs32\b\loch
Are you sure? I think you're wrong}
\par \pard\plain \s22\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa140\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch\ql{\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\loch\fs22\b0\loch
Yes, I\uc2 \u8217\'81\'66m sure.\uc1 }
\par \pard\plain \s22\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa140\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052{\loch
The claim that Einstein failed math is one of the most thoroughly debunked myths about him. Here\uc2 \u8217\'81\'66s the clear historical record:\uc1 }
\par \pard\plain \s22\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa140\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch{\listtext\pard\plain \rtlch\af7 \ltrch\hich\af7\loch\f7\dbch\af7 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls20 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\tx0\li709\ri0\lin709\rin0\fi-283\sb0\sa0{\loch
His school certificates show excellent grades in mathematics. On his final Swiss secondary-school exams (Matura), he received the highest possible mark (6/6) in algebra, geometry, descriptive geometry, and physics. }
\par \pard\plain \s22\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa140\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch{\listtext\pard\plain \rtlch\af7 \ltrch\hich\af7\loch\f7\dbch\af7 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls20 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\tx0\li709\ri0\lin709\rin0\fi-283\sb0\sa0{\loch
He mastered calculus on his own by age 15. }
\par \pard\plain \s22\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa140\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch{\listtext\pard\plain \rtlch\af7 \ltrch\hich\af7\loch\f7\dbch\af7 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls20 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\tx0\li709\ri0\lin709\rin0\fi-283\sb0\sa0{\loch
When he failed the Zurich Polytechnic entrance exam in 1895, it was because of weak performance in non-science subjects (especially languages and some natural sciences). He did well on the math and physics sections. }
\par \pard\plain \s22\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa140\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch{\listtext\pard\plain \rtlch\af7 \ltrch\hich\af7\loch\f7\dbch\af7 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls20 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\tx0\li709\ri0\lin709\rin0\fi-283{\loch
Einstein himself directly denied the story when it was repeated in his lifetime. }
\par \pard\plain \s22\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa140\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052{\loch
The myth mainly comes from:}
\par \pard\plain \s22\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa140\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch{\listtext\pard\plain  1.\tab}\ilvl0\ls21 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\tx0\li709\ri0\lin709\rin0\fi-283\sb0\sa0{\loch
Confusion about the Swiss grading system (6 was the best grade, not a failure). }
\par \pard\plain \s22\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa140\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch{\listtext\pard\plain  2.\tab}\ilvl0\ls21 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\tx0\li709\ri0\lin709\rin0\fi-283\sb0\sa0{\loch
Mixing up his overall failure on the first Polytechnic entrance exam with a failure in math. }
\par \pard\plain \s22\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa140\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch{\listtext\pard\plain  3.\tab}\ilvl0\ls21 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\tx0\li709\ri0\lin709\rin0\fi-283{\loch
Later popular exaggerations. }
\par \pard\plain \s22\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa140\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052{\loch
If you have a specific source that says he failed math, feel free to share it and I\uc2 \u8217\'81\'66ll check it. Otherwise, the primary documents and serious biographies all agree: Einstein was strong in mathematics from early on.\uc1 }
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch\ql\rtlch\afs32\ab \ltrch\loch\fs32\b\loch

\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch\ql{\rtlch\afs32\ab \ltrch\loch\fs32\b\loch
Obviously Python is the worst programming language}
\par \pard\plain \s22\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa140\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch\ql{\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\loch\fs22\b0\loch
