C, Rust, C++}\cell\row\pard\pard\plain \s22\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa140\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052{\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\loch\fs22\b0\loch
So Python isn\uc2 \u8217\'81\'66t the worst. It\u8217\'81\'66s a high-level, productivity-focused language that trades raw performance and strictness for speed of development and readability. For many real-world tasks, that trade-off is excellent. For others, it\u8217\'81\'66s the wrong tool.\uc1 }
\par \pard\plain \s22\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa140\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052{\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\loch\fs22\b0\loch
If you have specific reasons you think it\uc2 \u8217\'81\'66s the worst, feel free to list them \u8212\'81\'5c happy to discuss those points directly.\uc1 }
\par \pard\plain \s22\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa140\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052{\rtlch\afs32\ab \ltrch\loch\fs32\b\loch
Ok then i wanna ask you python or C++,choose one}
\par \pard\plain \s22\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa140\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch\ql{\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\lang1033\loch\cs16\rtlch\ab \ltrch\loch\b\fs22\lang1033\b0\loch
Python.}
\par \pard\plain \s22\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa140\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052{\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\loch\fs22\b0\loch
Here\uc2 \u8217\'81\'66s why I\u8217\'81\'66d choose it over C++ in most situations:\uc1 }
\par \pard\plain \s22\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa140\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch{\listtext\pard\plain \rtlch\af7 \ltrch\hich\af7\loch\f7\dbch\af7 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls16 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\tx0\li709\ri0\lin709\rin0\fi-283\sb0\sa0{\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\loch\fs22\b0\loch
Far faster to write and iterate }
\par \pard\plain \s22\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa140\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch{\listtext\pard\plain \rtlch\af7 \ltrch\hich\af7\loch\f7\dbch\af7 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls16 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\tx0\li709\ri0\lin709\rin0\fi-283\sb0\sa0{\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\loch\fs22\b0\loch
Much more readable and maintainable for the majority of real-world projects }
\par \pard\plain \s22\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa140\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch{\listtext\pard\plain \rtlch\af7 \ltrch\hich\af7\loch\f7\dbch\af7 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls16 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\tx0\li709\ri0\lin709\rin0\fi-283\sb0\sa0{\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\loch\fs22\b0\loch
Massive ecosystem (especially in AI, data, automation, scripting, and web) }
\par \pard\plain \s22\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa140\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch{\listtext\pard\plain \rtlch\af7 \ltrch\hich\af7\loch\f7\dbch\af7 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls16 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\tx0\li709\ri0\lin709\rin0\fi-283{\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\loch\fs22\b0\loch
Lower cognitive overhead \uc2 \u8212\'81\'5c you spend more time solving the actual problem and less time fighting the language \uc1 }
\par \pard\plain \s22\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa140\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052{\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\loch\fs22\b0\loch
C++ is the better tool when you need maximum performance, precise control over memory, or are working on systems/game engines/embedded software. In those domains it wins clearly.}
\par \pard\plain \s22\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa140\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052{\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\loch\fs22\b0\loch
But if I have to pick }{\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\loch\cs16\rtlch\ab \ltrch\loch\b\fs22\b0\loch
one}{\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\loch\fs22\b0\loch
 language to use for the broadest range of tasks in 2026, it\uc2 \u8217\'81\'66s Python.\uc1 }
\par \pard\plain \s22\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa140\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052{\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\loch\fs22\b0\loch
Your turn: What\uc2 \u8217\'81\'66s the main kind of work you\u8217\'81\'66re thinking about? That usually decides it more than general preference.\uc1 }
\par \pard\plain \s22\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa140\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\loch\fs22\b0\loch

\par \pard\plain \s22\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa140\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052{\rtlch\afs32\ab \ltrch\loch\fs32\b\loch
But i think C++ is better after all}
\par \pard\plain \s22\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa140\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch\ql\sb0\sa0{\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\lang1033\loch\fs22\lang1033\b0\loch
That\uc2 \u8217\'81\'66s a fair position.\uc1 }
\par \pard\plain \s22\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa140\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch\sb0\sa0{\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\loch\fs22\b0\loch
C++ is better than Python in several important ways:}
\par \pard\plain \s22\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa140\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch{\listtext\pard\plain \rtlch\af7 \ltrch\hich\af7\loch\f7\dbch\af7 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls17 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\tx0\li709\ri0\lin709\rin0\fi-283\sb0\sa0{\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\loch\cs16\rtlch\ab \ltrch\loch\b\fs22\b0\loch
Performance}{\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\loch\fs22\b0\loch
: Significantly faster execution and much lower memory usage. }
\par \pard\plain \s22\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa140\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch{\listtext\pard\plain \rtlch\af7 \ltrch\hich\af7\loch\f7\dbch\af7 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls17 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\tx0\li709\ri0\lin709\rin0\fi-283\sb0\sa0{\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\loch\cs16\rtlch\ab \ltrch\loch\b\fs22\b0\loch
Control}{\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\loch\fs22\b0\loch
: You get deterministic resource management, fine-grained control over memory, and zero-cost abstractions when written well. }
\par \pard\plain \s22\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa140\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch{\listtext\pard\plain \rtlch\af7 \ltrch\hich\af7\loch\f7\dbch\af7 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls17 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\tx0\li709\ri0\lin709\rin0\fi-283\sb0\sa0{\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\loch\cs16\rtlch\ab \ltrch\loch\b\fs22\b0\loch
Systems-level work}{\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\loch\fs22\b0\loch
: Better suited for game engines, operating systems, high-frequency trading, embedded systems, and anything that needs to run close to the hardware. }
\par \pard\plain \s22\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa140\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch{\listtext\pard\plain \rtlch\af7 \ltrch\hich\af7\loch\f7\dbch\af7 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls17 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\tx0\li709\ri0\lin709\rin0\fi-283{\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\loch\cs16\rtlch\ab \ltrch\loch\b\fs22\b0\loch
Longevity in large codebases}{\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\loch\fs22\b0\loch
: With modern C++ (C++17/20/23), strong typing, and good architecture, large projects can be more robust than large dynamically-typed Python codebases. }
\par \pard\plain \s22\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa140\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052{\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\loch\fs22\b0\loch
Python\uc2 \u8217\'81\'66s advantages (speed of development, readability, ecosystem in data/AI) are real, but they come at the cost of runtime performance and sometimes long-term maintainability.\uc1 }
\par \pard\plain \s22\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa140\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052{\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\loch\fs22\b0\loch
So it really depends on what you value most and what kind of software you\uc2 \u8217\'81\'66re building.\uc1 }
\par \pard\plain \s22\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa140\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052{\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\loch\fs22\b0\loch
What makes you lean toward C++? Is it performance, control, the kind of projects you work on, or something else?}
