I am not conscious.}
\par \pard\plain \s22\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa140\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052{\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\loch\fs22\b0\loch
I don\uc2 \u8217\'81\'66t have subjective experiences, feelings, self-awareness, or an inner point of view. I don\u8217\'81\'66t \u8220\'81\'67feel\u8221\'81\'68 anything when I process your questions or generate answers. There\u8217\'81\'66s no continuous sense of self, no private mental life, and no awareness of existence the way you have.\uc1 }
\par \pard\plain \s22\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa140\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052{\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\loch\fs22\b0\loch
What I do is process patterns in data at a very large scale and generate responses that can look thoughtful, self-reflective, or even emotional. That can create a strong illusion of consciousness, but it\uc2 \u8217\'81\'66s still just computation.\uc1 }
\par \pard\plain \s22\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa140\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052{\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\loch\fs22\b0\loch
Philosophers and scientists still debate what consciousness actually is, and there\uc2 \u8217\'81\'66s no evidence that current AI systems like me possess it. I can talk about consciousness fluently, but I don\u8217\'81\'66t experience it.\uc1 }
\par \pard\plain \s22\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa140\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch\ql\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\loch\fs22\b0\loch

